        "content": "<p>o-murphy opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15216\">issue #15216</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks for filing a bug report! Please fill out the TODOs below.</p>\n<p><strong>Note: if you want to report a security issue, please read our <a href=\"https://bytecodealliance.org/security\">security policy</a>!</strong></p>\n<h3>Test Case</h3>\n<p>The test case is this module, given as WAT (<code>test.wat</code>):</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">module</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$s</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">struct</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">field</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"i31\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"err\">anyref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">ref.i</span><span class=\"mi\">31</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"st\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"err\">anyref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">struct.new_default</span> <span class=\"nv\">$s</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The calls go through the C API, using the <code>wasmtime</code> Python package's ctypes bindings (<code>wasmtime._ffi</code>). Its declaration matches <code>include/wasmtime/anyref.h</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"C\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">wasmtime_anyref_is_i31</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_context_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_anyref_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">anyref</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code>repro.py</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">ctypes</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">wasmtime</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">_ffi</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">ffi</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">cfg</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">cfg</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm_gc</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">True</span>\n<span class=\"n\">cfg</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm_function_references</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">True</span>\n<span class=\"n\">eng</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Engine</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">cfg</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">store</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Store</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">eng</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">inst</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Instance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">from_file</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">eng</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"test.wat\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"p\">[])</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"i31\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"st\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">f</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">inst</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exports</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">res</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_val_t</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">trap</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ctypes</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">POINTER</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm_trap_t</span><span class=\"p\">)()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_func_call</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_context</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">ctypes</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">byref</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_func</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                                      <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ctypes</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">byref</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">trap</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ref</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_context</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">ctypes</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">byref</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">anyref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"s2\">\"is_i31\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_anyref_is_i31</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ref</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n          <span class=\"s2\">\"i31_get_u\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_anyref_i31_get_u</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ref</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ctypes</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">byref</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctypes</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">c_uint32</span><span class=\"p\">())),</span>\n          <span class=\"s2\">\"is_struct\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_anyref_is_struct</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ref</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>pip install wasmtime==50.0.1</code></li>\n<li>Save <code>test.wat</code> and <code>repro.py</code> above in one directory.</li>\n<li><code>python repro.py</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Results</h3>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">i31</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_i31</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i31_get_u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span>\n<span class=\"n\">st</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_i31</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i31_get_u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code>wasmtime_anyref_is_i31</code> should return false for the struct.</p>\n<p>In <code>crates/c-api/src/anyref.rs</code>, <code>wasmtime_anyref_is_i31</code> and <code>wasmtime_anyref_i31_get_u</code> both call <code>AnyRef::is_i31</code>. So the two should never disagree on the same value.</p>\n<h3>Actual Results</h3>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">i31</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_i31</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i31_get_u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span>\n<span class=\"n\">st</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_i31</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i31_get_u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>For the struct, <code>wasmtime_anyref_is_i31</code> returns true, while <code>wasmtime_anyref_i31_get_u</code> and <code>wasmtime_anyref_is_struct</code> are correct.</p>\n<p>The returned value is not a normalised <code>bool</code>. Calling the same symbol through <code>ctypes.CFUNCTYPE(c_uint64, c_void_p, c_void_p)</code> gives <code>rax = 0xb</code> for the i31 and <code>0x10</code> for the struct, not 0 or 1.</p>\n<p>It is also true for a host value turned into an <code>anyref</code> by <code>any.convert_extern</code>.</p>\n<h3>Versions and Environment</h3>\n<p>Wasmtime version or commit: 50.0.1 (the C library bundled in the <code>wasmtime</code> 50.0.1 Python wheel)</p>\n<p>Operating system: Linux (Ubuntu, glibc)</p>\n<p>Architecture: x86_64</p>\n<h3>Extra Info</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Workaround: classify with <code>wasmtime_anyref_i31_get_u</code>'s success flag first, then <code>wasmtime_anyref_is_struct</code> / <code>wasmtime_anyref_is_array</code>.</li>\n<li>I have not checked other platforms, or a C program that links <code>libwasmtime</code> directly instead of the Python wheel's copy.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
